D.1 valid basic 
Source: examples/valid_basic.pipe. The text below is copied verbatim. 
pipeline student_prediction { 
    load "students.csv"; 
    clean missing_values; 
    select cgpa, attendance, study_hours; 
    split train = 80%; 
    train model = decision_tree; 
    evaluate model; 
} 

D.2 valid drop 
Source: examples/valid_drop.pipe. The text below is copied verbatim. 
pipeline student_prediction { 
    load "students.csv"; 
    clean missing_values; 
    drop student_id, name; 
    select cgpa, attendance, study_hours; 
    split train = 80%; 
    train model = decision_tree; 
    evaluate model; 
} 

D.3 optimizer demo 
Source: examples/optimizer_demo.pipe. The text below is copied verbatim. 
pipeline student_prediction { 
    load "students.csv"; 
    clean missing_values; 
    clean missing_values; 
    drop student_id; 
    drop name; 
    select cgpa, attendance, study_hours; 
    split train = 80%; 
    train model1 = decision_tree; 
    train dead_model = logistic_regression; 
    evaluate model1; 
    train trailing_model = svm; 
}

